  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Incident Report\r\nOctober 4 - 2012\r\n\nPoliceman Duncan Rogers was reported
    as missing after failing to check in with his patrol\r           partner 4 hours
    after he\u2019d last checked in.\r\n\nHe was last seen entering a house just
    beyond Redwood Avenue, an old dilapidated house\r      which the subject Rogers
    was dispatched to check out when the police firm received multiple\r                      
    reports of strange activity and behaviors exhibited from the house\u2019s single
    resident, Becky\r                              Walters.\r\n\nBehaviors that that
    boil down to complete self-isolation for the past week, reported sightings of\r                     
    rapidly moving lights and shadows coming from the old lady\u2019s house despite
    her living alone,\r\nand the broadcasted creaks and groans emanating from the
    house that the residents of\r             Redwood find quite frankly supernatural
    in nature.\r\n\nThe F.E.A.R. (Federal Emergency for Abnormal Residents) has reason
    to believe that a\r       mutation had occurred on the premises on account of
    the fact that ghosts were proven as\r                      nonexistent in the
    year 2006 and has requested aid from the G.P.A (Global Pobophycosis\r                          
    Agency).\r\n\nTwo Agents were sent to evaluate the situation and determine if
    elimination of the mutated\r            suspect is necessary or if the suspect
    can be taken into custody"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 57724558274d8394298e97951ef39d60, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 3331701279051340915, guid: 57724558274d8394298e97951ef39d60, type: 2}
